{% comment %}
  Comprehensive Store Policies Section
  - Refund Policy (No refund on digital eBooks, 14-day refund on physical hardcopy)
  - Terms of Service
  - Privacy Policy
  - Shipping & Digital Delivery Policy
  - Contact Us
{% endcomment %}

<div class="policy-page-container">
  <div class="policy-wrapper">
    <!-- Header -->
    <div class="policy-header">
      <span class="policy-badge">Legal & Information</span>
      <h1 class="policy-main-title">Store Policies & Customer Information</h1>
      <p class="policy-subtitle">Last updated: September 2026. Please review our terms, return policies, and privacy guidelines.</p>
    </div>

    <!-- Quick Navigation Pills -->
    <div class="policy-nav-pills">
      <a href="#refund-policy" class="policy-nav-link active" onclick="switchPolicyTab(event, 'refund-policy')">🛡️ Refund Policy</a>
      <a href="#terms-of-service" class="policy-nav-link" onclick="switchPolicyTab(event, 'terms-of-service')">📜 Terms of Service</a>
      <a href="#privacy-policy" class="policy-nav-link" onclick="switchPolicyTab(event, 'privacy-policy')">🔒 Privacy Policy</a>
      <a href="#shipping-policy" class="policy-nav-link" onclick="switchPolicyTab(event, 'shipping-policy')">📦 Shipping & Delivery</a>
      <a href="#contact-us" class="policy-nav-link" onclick="switchPolicyTab(event, 'contact-us')">✉️ Contact & Support</a>
    </div>

    <!-- Policy Cards Container -->
    <div class="policy-content-card">

      <!-- 1. REFUND & RETURN POLICY -->
      <section id="refund-policy" class="policy-tab-content active">
        <div class="policy-section-header">
          <div class="policy-icon-badge">🛡️</div>
          <div>
            <h2>Refund & Return Policy</h2>
            <p>Our clear guidelines on digital downloads versus physical book orders.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="policy-alert-box alert-orange">
          <div class="alert-icon">⚡</div>
          <div>
            <strong>Digital Products (eBooks & Blueprint PDFs): No Refunds</strong>
            <p style="margin: 4px 0 0 0; font-size: 14px;">
              Due to the immediate delivery and digital nature of downloadable files (PDFs, design blueprints, clearance charts), <strong>all digital eBook sales are final and non-refundable</strong> once purchased or downloaded.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="policy-alert-box alert-green" style="margin-top: 16px;">
          <div class="alert-icon">📦</div>
          <div>
            <strong>Physical Products (Hardcover & Print Editions): 14-Day Refund Window</strong>
            <p style="margin: 4px 0 0 0; font-size: 14px;">
              We offer a <strong>14-day return and refund policy</strong> from the date of physical delivery for any hardcopy design book.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <h3 class="policy-subheading">Conditions for 14-Day Hardcopy Returns</h3>
        <p>To be eligible for a return on a physical hardcopy book, the following conditions must be met:</p>
        <ul class="policy-list">
          <li>The return request must be initiated within <strong>14 calendar days</strong> of the verified delivery date.</li>
          <li>The book must be in its original, unused, and resellable condition with all protective shrinkwrap and bookmarks intact.</li>
          <li>Proof of purchase (Shopify order confirmation email or order number) is required.</li>
          <li>Customers are responsible for return shipping costs unless the book arrived damaged or misprinted.</li>
        </ul>

        <h3 class="policy-subheading">Damaged, Defective, or Misprinted Copies</h3>
        <p>
          If your physical book arrives damaged during transit or contains printing errors, please inspect your package upon receipt and contact us within <strong>48 hours</strong> at <strong>support@kitchenind.com</strong> with your order number and clear photos of the defect. We will immediately arrange a free replacement or a full refund at zero additional cost to you.
        </p>

        <h3 class="policy-subheading">Refund Processing Time</h3>
        <p>
          Once your returned hardcopy is received and inspected by our fulfillment center, we will notify you of the approval or rejection of your refund. Approved refunds will be automatically credited to your original payment method (UPI, credit/debit card, or netbanking) within <strong>5 to 7 business days</strong>.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- 2. TERMS OF SERVICE -->
      <section id="terms-of-service" class="policy-tab-content">
        <div class="policy-section-header">
          <div class="policy-icon-badge">📜</div>
          <div>
            <h2>Terms of Service</h2>
            <p>Guidelines governing the purchase, licensing, and usage of our design resources.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <h3 class="policy-subheading">1. Digital License & Intellectual Property</h3>
        <p>
          All design books, layout blueprints, clearance charts, technical illustrations, and written materials available on this store are the exclusive intellectual property of the author and publisher. 
        </p>
        <ul class="policy-list">
          <li><strong>Single-User License:</strong> Each eBook purchase grants a non-exclusive, non-transferable, single-user license for personal study and reference on your own residential design or renovation projects.</li>
          <li><strong>Prohibited Uses:</strong> You may not redistribute, resell, share, upload to public file-sharing networks, sub-license, or republish any part of this work in whole or in part without prior written permission.</li>
        </ul>

        <h3 class="policy-subheading">2. Professional Disclaimer</h3>
        <p>
          The clearance dimensions, ergonomics, and construction standards provided in our books are based on industry-standard architectural practices and manufacturer recommendations. However, because local building codes, plumbing regulations, and appliance specifications vary by region and municipality, readers should verify clearances against their specific local codes and manufacturer guidelines before beginning construction.
        </p>

        <h3 class="policy-subheading">3. Order Acceptance & Pricing</h3>
        <p>
          We reserve the right to refuse or cancel any order for reasons including availability, inaccuracies in pricing or product descriptions, or suspected fraudulent activity. Prices for all products are subject to change without notice.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- 3. PRIVACY POLICY -->
      <section id="privacy-policy" class="policy-tab-content">
        <div class="policy-section-header">
          <div class="policy-icon-badge">🔒</div>
          <div>
            <h2>Privacy Policy</h2>
            <p>How we collect, protect, and handle your personal data.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <h3 class="policy-subheading">1. Information We Collect</h3>
        <p>When you place an order on our store, we collect necessary transaction details:</p>
        <ul class="policy-list">
          <li><strong>Contact Details:</strong> Your name and email address to send digital download links, order confirmations, and updates.</li>
          <li><strong>Shipping Information (Hardcopy Only):</strong> Physical mailing address and phone number for courier delivery and tracking notifications.</li>
          <li><strong>Device & Analytics Data:</strong> IP address, browser type, and cookie identifiers to protect against fraud and optimize website loading speeds.</li>
        </ul>

        <h3 class="policy-subheading">2. Payment Security</h3>
        <p>
          We take payment security very seriously. <strong>We do not store, process, or have access to your credit card numbers, debit card details, or UPI PINs.</strong> All transactions are processed through Level 1 PCI-DSS certified payment processors (Shopify Payments, Razorpay, or Stripe) using 256-bit SSL encryption.
        </p>

        <h3 class="policy-subheading">3. We Never Sell Your Data</h3>
        <p>
          Your email address and personal information will never be sold, rented, or shared with third-party advertisers. We use your contact information strictly for fulfilling your orders and providing customer support.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- 4. SHIPPING & DELIVERY -->
      <section id="shipping-policy" class="policy-tab-content">
        <div class="policy-section-header">
          <div class="policy-icon-badge">📦</div>
          <div>
            <h2>Shipping & Delivery Policy</h2>
            <p>Delivery timelines for digital downloads and physical book orders.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <h3 class="policy-subheading">Digital eBook Delivery (Instant)</h3>
        <p>
          Digital products (including the Kitchen Design Book PDF and companion digital guides) are delivered <strong>instantly</strong> upon successful payment.
        </p>
        <ul class="policy-list">
          <li>You will be immediately redirected to an on-screen download page after completing checkout.</li>
          <li>A permanent backup download link will be automatically sent to your provided email address within 60 seconds.</li>
          <li>If you do not see the confirmation email in your primary inbox, please check your Promotions or Spam folder, or contact support for an instant resend.</li>
        </ul>

        <h3 class="policy-subheading">Physical Hardcopy Shipping Timelines</h3>
        <p>For orders containing printed physical hardcover or paperback editions:</p>
        <ul class="policy-list">
          <li><strong>Order Processing:</strong> Hardcopy orders are processed and packed within 24 to 48 business hours.</li>
          <li><strong>Domestic Delivery:</strong> Ships via insured express courier and typically arrives within <strong>3 to 7 business days</strong>.</li>
          <li><strong>Tracking Number:</strong> A tracking link will be sent to your email and SMS as soon as your parcel is dispatched from our fulfillment warehouse.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <!-- 5. CONTACT & SUPPORT -->
      <section id="contact-us" class="policy-tab-content">
        <div class="policy-section-header">
          <div class="policy-icon-badge">✉️</div>
          <div>
            <h2>Contact & Customer Support</h2>
            <p>We are here to help with any questions about your order or download.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div style="background: #fafaf9; border-radius: 16px; padding: 24px; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; margin: 20px 0;">
          <h4 style="margin: 0 0 12px 0; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700;">Customer Support Desk</h4>
          <p style="margin: 0 0 8px 0; font-size: 14px; color: #4b5563;">
            <strong>Email Support:</strong> <a href="mailto:support@kitchenind.com" style="color: #ea580c; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600;">support@kitchenind.com</a>
          </p>
          <p style="margin: 0 0 8px 0; font-size: 14px; color: #4b5563;">
            <strong>Support Hours:</strong> Monday – Saturday, 9:00 AM – 6:00 PM IST
          </p>
          <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 14px; color: #4b5563;">
            <strong>Typical Response Time:</strong> Within 12 to 24 hours
          </p>
        </div>

        <p style="font-size: 14px; color: #6b7280;">
          When contacting us regarding an existing order, please include your <strong>Order Number</strong> (e.g. #1001) and the email address used during checkout so we can resolve your inquiry as quickly as possible.
        </p>
      </section>

    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
.policy-page-container {
  font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;
  color: #111827;
  background: #fdfdfd;
  padding: 50px 20px 90px 20px;
  line-height: 1.6;
}
.policy-wrapper {
  max-width: 960px;
  margin: 0 auto;
}
.policy-header {
  text-align: center;
  margin-bottom: 40px;
}
.policy-badge {
  display: inline-block;
  background: #ffedd5;
  color: #ea580c;
  padding: 6px 16px;
  border-radius: 20px;
  font-size: 12px;
  font-weight: 800;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  margin-bottom: 14px;
}
.policy-main-title {
  font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif !important;
  font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem) !important;
  font-weight: 800 !important;
  color: #09090b !important;
  margin: 0 0 12px 0 !important;
  letter-spacing: -0.025em;
}
.policy-subtitle {
  color: #6b7280;
  font-size: 15px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  max-width: 600px;
}
.policy-nav-pills {
  display: flex;
  gap: 10px;
  justify-content: center;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  margin-bottom: 30px;
}
.policy-nav-link {
  background: #ffffff;
  border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
  padding: 10px 18px;
  border-radius: 30px;
  font-size: 13.5px;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: #4b5563;
  text-decoration: none;
  transition: all 0.2s ease;
  box-shadow: 0 2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.03);
}
.policy-nav-link:hover {
  border-color: #ea580c;
  color: #ea580c;
  transform: translateY(-1px);
}
.policy-nav-link.active {
  background: #09090b;
  color: #ffffff;
  border-color: #09090b;
}
.policy-content-card {
  background: #ffffff;
  border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
  border-radius: 24px;
  padding: 40px 36px;
  box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.04);
}
.policy-tab-content {
  display: none;
}
.policy-tab-content.active {
  display: block;
  animation: policyFade 0.25s ease-out;
}
@keyframes policyFade {
  from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(6px); }
  to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
}
.policy-section-header {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 16px;
  margin-bottom: 24px;
  padding-bottom: 20px;
  border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6;
}
.policy-section-header h2 {
  font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
  font-size: 24px;
  font-weight: 800;
  margin: 0;
  color: #09090b;
}
.policy-section-header p {
  margin: 4px 0 0 0;
  color: #6b7280;
  font-size: 14px;
}
.policy-icon-badge {
  font-size: 28px;
  width: 56px;
  height: 56px;
  background: #fff7ed;
  border: 1px solid #fed7aa;
  border-radius: 16px;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  flex-shrink: 0;
}
.policy-alert-box {
  display: flex;
  gap: 14px;
  padding: 16px 20px;
  border-radius: 16px;
  align-items: flex-start;
}
.policy-alert-box.alert-orange {
  background: #fff7ed;
  border: 1px solid #fed7aa;
  color: #9a3412;
}
.policy-alert-box.alert-green {
  background: #f0fdf4;
  border: 1px solid #bbf7d0;
  color: #166534;
}
.alert-icon {
  font-size: 20px;
  line-height: 1;
}
.policy-subheading {
  font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
  font-size: 18px;
  font-weight: 700;
  margin: 28px 0 10px 0;
  color: #111827;
}
.policy-list {
  padding-left: 20px;
  margin: 10px 0 16px 0;
}
.policy-list li {
  margin-bottom: 8px;
  font-size: 14.5px;
  color: #374151;
}
p {
  font-size: 14.5px;
  color: #374151;
  line-height: 1.7;
}
</style>

<script>
function switchPolicyTab(event, targetId) {
  event.preventDefault();
  
  document.querySelectorAll('.policy-nav-link').forEach(link => {
    link.classList.remove('active');
  });
  event.currentTarget.classList.add('active');

  document.querySelectorAll('.policy-tab-content').forEach(content => {
    content.classList.remove('active');
  });
  const targetSection = document.getElementById(targetId);
  if (targetSection) {
    targetSection.classList.add('active');
  }

  history.replaceState(null, null, '#' + targetId);
}

document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function() {
  const hash = window.location.hash ? window.location.hash.substring(1) : '';
  if (hash) {
    const matchedLink = document.querySelector('.policy-nav-link[href="#' + hash + '"]');
    if (matchedLink) {
      matchedLink.click();
    }
  }
});
</script>

